WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: ha

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Sannu, wannan shine Tsarin Lamba.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.350
Manhaja tana da sarkakiya

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.890
Da farko dai, akwai lambar sirri da yawa da ake buƙatar a rubuta.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.710
Misalin ayyukan da na ƙirƙira don wannan jerin

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.270
Lambar tana da layuka sama da 12,000.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.320
Idan ainihin sabis ne na aiki

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.530
Ko da ƙaramin sabis ne, zai wuce layuka 100,000 cikin sauƙi.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.300
Layuka dubu ɗari sun isa su cika littattafai ashirin.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.560
Rubuta dogon lambar ba yana nufin ya ƙare ba.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.540
Dole ne ka ci gaba da gyara lambar da kake rubutawa.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.800
Idan ka gyara A, B zai karye.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.130
Idan ka gyara B, A da C za su lalace.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.260
Idan aka yi amfani da misalin, kamar an kama mutum a cikin Rasputica da kuka ne.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.360
Za ka iya cewa yanayi ne makamancin haka da doki.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.550
A wannan lokacin, za ku ji buƙatar ƙira.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.010
Amma idan ka yi ƙoƙarin rubuta takardar zane,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.490
Bayyana tunanin da ke cikin zuciyarka a zahiri

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.260
Za ku gane cewa ba abu ne mai sauƙi kamar yadda kuke tsammani ba.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:05.600
Ko da waƙar takarda, wacce takarda ce da ke ɗaukar sauti ko kiɗa da ido,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.700
Wannan abu ne mai rikitarwa

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.610
Ba wai kawai kiɗa ba, har ma da kuɗi da dabaru

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:14.060
Ƙarin ra'ayoyi daban-daban da buƙatun mai amfani marasa ma'ana

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:17.220
Ba zai zama da sauƙi a bayyana shi a cikin wani takamaiman tsari ba.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.490
Abin farin ciki

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:23.200
Don shawo kan wahalar yin kwaikwayon ra'ayoyi marasa ma'ana

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.860
An haifi UML a ƙarshen shekarun 1990.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.120
Grady Butch ne ya jagorance ta.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.390
Muna amfani da UML tare da tsammani

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.990
Zana zane na aji

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.760
Bari mu kuma zana zane mai tsari

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:39.980
duk da haka

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.160
Lokacin da na yi ƙoƙarin tsara shi, ya bambanta da rubuta shi kai tsaye.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.130
Da alama ba ta bambanta sosai ba

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:46.520
Me yasa hakan?

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.910
Wannan kuwa saboda tsarin tunani ya saba da aiwatarwa.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.170
Maimakon sanya ra'ayoyin da ba a iya fahimta ba su zama masu inganci,

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.590
Domin yana fassara tunanin matakin aiwatarwa zuwa UML.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.270
Kawai saboda zaka iya karanta littafin rubutu

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.950
Ba kamar zan iya rubuta shi ba ne

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.850
Kawai saboda ka koyi UML

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.170
Ba kamar kana haɓaka ƙwarewar ƙira ba ne.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.300
Don haka a cikin wannan jerin

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.580
Ta hanyar ayyukan gaske

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.420
Yadda ake yin simintin ƙa'idodi masu rikitarwa

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.290
Za a iya haɗa lambar?

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.010
Ina so in nuna maka kai tsaye

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.930
Na zaɓi yin booking na tikitin fim ta hanyar domain

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.200
Yin rajistar tikitin fina-finai abu ne mai sauƙin fahimta domin galibinsu wurare ne da aka saba da su.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.710
Ya haɗa da ayyuka daban-daban kamar shiga, biyan kuɗi, da zaɓin wurin zama.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.580
Da alama misali ne mai kyau

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.890
Ainihin, batun wannan labarin shine ƙirar software, amma

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.350
Za mu kuma yi bayani game da ci gaban da aka yi bisa gwaji.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.890
Yanayin ci gaba na zamani yana tallafawa kayan aikin gwaji.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.320
Ko da kun kalli shahararrun ayyukan bude tushen,

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:51.130
Muna da wani matakin gwaji.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:56.200
Wannan yana nufin cewa gwaji yana da matuƙar muhimmanci kuma yana da amfani.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.120
Amma a zahiri

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.590
A lokuta da yawa, ba wai TDD kawai ba, har ma da gwajin atomatik ba a aiwatar da shi yadda ya kamata.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.260
Rubuta jarrabawa masu ma'ana da farko ba tare da wani shiri ba shine

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.540
Ba ya taɓa zama mai sauƙi ba

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:12.340
Wannan wani abu ne da ke buƙatar haɗin gwiwar ƙwarewar ƙirar software.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.270
Don haka, ya fi kyau a yi mu'amala da ƙira da TDD tare.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.180
Na yi zaton yana da inganci

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.450
Don haka yanzu bari mu fara taron farko na aikin.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.470
Domin wannan ƙaramin aiki ne

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.090
Akwai masu halarta guda biyu

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.340
Wanda ke hagu ƙwararren mai bincike ne a fannin yanki (domain), wanda ke gefen dama kuma mai haɓaka bayanai ne (developer).

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:37.790
Masana a fannin suna da ra'ayin kansu game da tsarin da muke buƙatar ginawa.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.280
Yana ba da labarai da yawa

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.160
Gidan wasan kwaikwayo da muke gudanarwa

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.710
Akwai kimanin su dubu huɗu a faɗin ƙasar.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.220
Zai iya ƙara ƙaruwa nan gaba.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.480
A halin yanzu, aikin yin rajistar tikitin fina-finai ne kawai ake tallafawa.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.510
Muna shirin ƙara tallace-tallacen tikiti don manyan wasanni daga baya.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.940
Kuma abu mafi mahimmanci shine kada ku taɓa yin amfani da kujerun yin booking sau biyu.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:03.250
A da, cibiyoyin kula da abokan ciniki sun sha wahala sosai da irin wannan matsalar.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.670
Domin akwai bayanai da yawa game da fim da kuma bayanan bita da aka riga aka tara.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:11.090
Dole ne waɗannan bayanai su kasance ba tare da wata matsala ba.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.730
A nan tattaunawar ta kasance mai tsari sosai, amma

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.960
A gaskiya, akwai ƙarin bayani

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.600
Za a isar da shi ta hanyar da ba ta da tsari

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.110
Amma labarin da ya fito a farkon aikin shine

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.780
Domin kuwa shine mafi mahimmancin buƙata

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.320
Dole ne ka saurara da kyau

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.810
Masu haɓakawa suna sauraron ƙwararrun yanki

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.290
Ina da wasu tambayoyi

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.660
Babban aikin yin rajistar tikitin aiki da kuka ambata

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.910
Yaushe za a ƙara shi?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.910
Shin ya kamata a haɗa wannan a cikin wannan aikin tun da wuri?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.590
Ko kuma ina so in sani ko ya kamata in yi la'akari da shi tukuna

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.090
Da kuma buƙatar kiyaye bayanan da ke akwai

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.940
Shin hakan yana nufin bai kamata mu canza tsarin DB ba?

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.950
Akwai wasu ayyuka da ke raba DB ɗin a halin yanzu?

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:54.980
Kamar yadda kake gani daga DB,

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.290
Domin ƙwararrun masu haɓaka shafin yanar gizo ba masu haɓaka shafin yanar gizo ba ne.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.430
Bayanin fasaha ba shi da tabbas

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.890
Masu haɓaka suna buƙatar duba waɗannan abubuwa a hankali.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.450
Masana a fannin yanar gizo suna amsa tambayoyin masu haɓaka shafin kamar haka:

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.210
Babban aikin ajiyar tikiti na aiki

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.450
Babu wani takamaiman jadawali tukuna.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.970
Duk da haka, idan aka ƙara fasaloli a nan gaba

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:18.700
Domin ku iya haɓakawa ba tare da wahala mai yawa ba

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.600
Ina ganin zai yi kyau idan za ka iya yin la'akari da shi a wannan karon.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:27.050
Ba ma amfani da DB don wani abu banda ayyukanmu.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:32.840
Sauya tsarin da kansa ba babbar matsala ba ce matuƙar ana kiyaye bayanan da kyau.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.080
Bayan jin labarin, sai ya

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:39.400
Ban tsammanin kana buƙatar damuwa da babban shirin ba.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.790
Ba shine iyakokin aikin ba

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.040
Bukatun ma ba a fayyace su ba

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.930
Ban san lokacin da zan buƙaci hakan ba, amma

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.710
Wannan matsala ce da za mu sake dubawa daga baya.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.910
Ko da ba a rubuta shi a cikin takardar ba

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.880
Masana fannin za su kuma bayar da amsa cewa za su yi la'akari da manyan ayyuka.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:55.960
Bai kamata ka manta ba

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.320
Shi ke nan

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.630
Sannan, aikin yin ajiyar tikiti mai girma

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:04.500
Ba zan sanya shi cikin manyan abubuwan da suka fi muhimmanci ga wannan aikin ba.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.220
Madadin haka, yana sauƙaƙa faɗaɗa ayyuka daga baya a cikin tsarin haɓakawa.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.190
Zan kula da shi sosai

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:12.840
Kada ka damu. Ku yarda da ni kawai

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.960
Yana da mahimmanci a yi mu'amala mai kyau

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.500
Ta hanyar tattaunawarmu zuwa yanzu

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.700
An taƙaita manyan abubuwan da suka fi muhimmanci kamar haka:

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.890
Wannan shine bayanin da kwararrun domains suka bayar.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.410
Fassarawa da tsarawa daga mahangar mai haɓakawa

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.810
Fara aikin

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.860
Tare da ƙwararrun yanki

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:34.980
Da zarar ka yanke shawara kan manufofin aikinka,

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.980
Yanzu lokaci ya yi da za ka ambaci sunan aikinka.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.840
Da farko, tambayi ƙwararren masanin fannin yanar gizo ra'ayinsa.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.540
Me ya kamata in sanya wa aikin suna?

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:47.680
Tsarin yin rajistar fina-finai ne.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:50.150
Yaya game da Tsarin Yin Rajistar Fina-finai kawai?

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:51.430
a'a, ba na so

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.570
Zan kula da manyan wasanni

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:56.930
Bari mu tafi da Tsarin Yin Rajistar Fina-finai. eh?

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.180
mai girma

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.950
na gode sosai

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.230
Ƙwararrun masu bincike na yanki na iya son sunayen ayyukan a cikin harshen Koriya.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.680
Amma daga mahangar mai haɓaka

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.990
Duk sharuɗɗan da suka haɗa da sunayen aikin

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.180
Domin an aiwatar da shi kai tsaye a cikin lambar,

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.000
Yana da sauƙi a fassara shi da Turanci idan zai yiwu.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:19.510
Yana da mahimmanci ga masu haɓaka su bi buƙatun ƙwararrun yanki da aminci, amma

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.430
Idan aka yi la'akari da dukkan aikin

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.930
Muna kuma da alhakin jagorantar al'amura zuwa ga hanya mai inganci.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:27.760
Idan ka yanke shawara kan suna don aikinka

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.380
Yanzu lokaci ya yi da za a gano wanda ke amfani da Tsarin Yin Rajistar Fina-finai.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:34.940
Hakika, ya kamata ka tambayi ƙwararren masanin yanki don ƙarin bayani game da wannan.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.740
Kuma mun gano cewa muna da abokan ciniki da manajoji.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.280
Ɗaya daga cikin abubuwan da ba a iya mantawa da su ba a farkon matakan ƙira shine

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.760
Dogara ce ta waje

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:46.580
Abubuwan da suka dogara da waje sune

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:49.210
Zai iya zama tsarin gado na yanzu,

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.420
Zai iya zama tsarin biyan kuɗi

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.670
Wannan dangantaka ta dogara ita ce

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:56.760
Domin kuwa zai iya yin babban tasiri ga tsarin gabaɗaya.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:00.150
Yana da mahimmanci a gano shi da wuri-wuri.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.240
sa'a

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.990
Abubuwa kamar hanyoyin biyan kuɗi da tsarin gado

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:07.730
Domin ana amfani da shi a tsarin da ake da shi a yanzu

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.360
Ana iya fahimtarsa ​​cikin sauƙi

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:14.410
Ɗaya daga cikin abubuwan da ke da sauƙin yin watsi da su a cikin dangantaka mai dogaro shine

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:16.090
Akwai abubuwan da suka shafi muhalli na waje

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:19.060
Ƙasarmu tana cikin yankin lokaci ɗaya

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.430
A ƙasar da ke da babban yanki na ƙasa, kowane gidan wasan kwaikwayo yana da lokaci daban-daban.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.100
Sai Tsarin Yin Rajistar Fina-finai

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.900
Babu makawa abubuwan da suka shafi muhalli kamar yankunan lokaci za su shafe shi.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:32.760
Waɗannan abubuwan ba sa bayyana a fili sai dai idan ka tambayi ƙwararren masanin yankin kai tsaye.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.950
Yana da sauƙin rasawa

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.610
Masana fannin suna yawan yin watsi da waɗannan bayanai.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:40.010
Domin za a iya cire bayanin

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.640
Tunda an bayyana dangantakar dogaro a sarari

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.500
Yanzu bari mu mayar da hankali kan abubuwan da ke cikin Tsarin Yin Rajistar Fina-finai.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:52.230
Da farko, me abokin ciniki ke yi a Tsarin Yin Rajistar Fina-finai?

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:54.230
Bari mu tambayi masana fannin yankin

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.880
Me abokan ciniki ke yi?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.970
Abokan ciniki suna neman fina-finai,

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.450
Duba cikakkun bayanai game da fim ɗin,

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.910
Zaɓi lokacin nunawa,

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.450
Zaɓi wurin zama,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.920
Yi rajistar tikitin fim,

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.610
Duba bayanan ajiyar wuri,

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.180
Yi abubuwa kamar soke yin booking

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:15.750
Shin zaɓar lokacin nuna fim da kuma zaɓar wurin zama wani ɓangare ne na tsarin yin rajistar tikitin fina-finai?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.880
Kuma don yin rajistar tikitin fim, don soke rajistar fim

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.210
Bayan haka, ba wai kawai kana sayen tikiti ka dawo da kudinka ba ne?

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.620
kana da gaskiya

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.030
Haka ne

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.880
Domin yanzu yanki ne da aka saba da shi

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.240
Zaɓi lokacin tantancewa kuma zaɓi wurin zama

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.200
Shin wannan ɓangare ne na tsarin yin rajistar tikitin fina-finai?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.530
Zan iya tambaya

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.220
Amma idan wani yanki ne da ba a saba gani ba,

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.160
Yin nazari dalla-dalla kan kowane yanayin amfani

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.330
Za ka maimaita aikin tacewa sau da yawa.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.350
Dangane da yanayin aikin

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.080
Za ka iya maimaita wannan tsari sau da yawa,

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
Da zarar ka ɗauki lokacinka ka yi nazari a hankali,

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
Rage gwaji da kurakurai yayin matakan ƙira da aiwatarwa.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Dangane da tattaunawar da aka yi zuwa yanzu

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Mun tsara yanayin amfani da abokan cinikinmu zuwa rukuni huɗu:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
Na gaba shine mai gudanarwa

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Mai gudanarwa zai iya ganin cewa akwai abubuwa guda biyar na gudanarwa:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
Ni da kaina, ina taka tsantsan game da amfani da kalmar "Manage" a cikin ci gaba.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
Gudanarwa ya yi faɗi sosai

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
Ba a san abin da kake yi ba

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Haka nan ma

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
Ta yaya ake sarrafa shi daidai?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Ban sani ba

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Ta hanyar yin magana da ƙwararrun masu bincike a yankin

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
An faɗaɗa kowane abu na gudanarwa zuwa takamaiman yanayin amfani.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Idan aiki ne na gaske

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
Akwai yiwuwar akwai ƙarin amfani fiye da wannan.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Ga shi nan na sauƙaƙa shi don bayani.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Abin da ya kamata a lura a nan shi ne, lokacin da aka tsara lokacin aiki,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
Za ka iya ganin cewa an ƙirƙiri tikitin kuma

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Kuma lokacin siyan ko mayar da tikiti

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
Haka kuma za ku iya ganin cewa muna amfani da sabis na waje da ake kira ƙofar biyan kuɗi.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Na haɗa shari'o'in amfani da abokan ciniki da manajoji.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Duba dukkan yanayin amfani kamar haka

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Wani abu yana jin babu komai

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Akwai zaɓi don ƙara gidan wasan kwaikwayo

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Ban ga wani abu kamar Search Theater ba

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
Da alama akwai wasu sharuɗɗan amfani da yawa da aka cire.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Domin kuwa daga mahangar ƙwararren masanin yanki, akwai abubuwa da yawa da za a yi bayani a kansu.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Wannan yanayin amfani, wanda ya bayyana a fili,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Za ka iya cire bayanin

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
To, daga mahangar mai haɓaka manhaja fa?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
Ya fi kyau a bar labarai masu sauƙi kamar neman gidan wasan kwaikwayo.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Shin wannan ba zai fi taimakawa wajen sarrafa takardu ba?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Idan ƙirar baya ce

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Sauƙaƙan amfani kamar neman gidan wasan kwaikwayo

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Ina ganin babu laifi a tsallake shi

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Abin da nake nufi shi ne, ba a makara ba wajen mayar da martani a lokacin aiwatarwa.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Amma idan aiki ne na gaske

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Ga masu tsara allo, waɗannan sharuɗɗan amfani suna da kyau wurin farawa.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Mai tsara shirin ya duba batun amfani da neman gidan wasan kwaikwayo.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Ta yaya zan iya samun damar bincika gidajen sinima?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
Za ka iya tunani

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Idan ka haɗa zane-zanen zuwa ɗaya, zai yi kama da mai rikitarwa.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Da ace aiki ne na gaske, da ya fi rikitarwa.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
A wannan yanayin, babu buƙatar tilasta haɗa kai.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Na haɗa su a nan ne kawai domin in bayyana cewa akwai wasu shari'o'in da suka ɓace.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Na cike dukkan akwatunan da suka ɓace

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Ina da wani misali inda aka cire haɗin kai da ɗan wasan kwaikwayo.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Wannan ya shafi abokan ciniki da manajoji.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Kuma don sauƙin aiwatarwa, na rubuta shi da Turanci.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Ba matsala yanzu domin ƙaramin aiki ne

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Idan aikin yana da girma kuma mai rikitarwa

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
Ina ya kamata ƙwararren masanin yanki ya fara bayani?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Yana iya zama da wahala

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Me mai gudanarwa ke yi?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Aiki ne mai yawa

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Kamar yadda ake tsammani daga manaja

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
A wannan yanayin, za mu iya raba 'yan wasan kwaikwayo?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Haka kuma kyakkyawan ra'ayi ne a yi bita

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Da farko an kira ni mai gudanarwa

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
Ana iya raba shi ta hanyar rawar da ya taka

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
Kuma amfani da Tsarin Buga Fina-finai

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Akwai ayyukan waje

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Idan muka rarraba 'yan wasan kwaikwayo kamar haka,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Masana fannin za su iya samar da ƙarin bayanai na tsari.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
Ba shakka, wannan misali ɗaya ne kawai na nazarin wani yanki mai rikitarwa.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Akwai wasu hanyoyi masu kyau da za a iya bi

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Yana da muhimmanci a mayar da martani cikin sassauci dangane da yanayin da ake ciki.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Wannan shine ƙarshe

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
A wannan karon, za mu yi amfani da tsarin misali na amfani

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Kafa manufofi don aikin

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Na shiga matakan farko na bincike.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Da kaina, a duk lokacin da ake ci gaba da aikin ci gaba

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Ina ganin bincike shine mafi wahala

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Domin dole ne mu tsara ra'ayoyi mafi rikitarwa da rashin tabbas.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Lokaci na gaba za mu duba manyan lamuran amfani

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Bari mu yi nazari sosai kan hakan

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Na gode da aikin da kuka yi tukuru zuwa yanzu.

